config TTY_TEST
    bool "Test terminal pair"
    default y
    help
      A terminal, tty0, and its line as a raw device, pty0:
      what pty0 is written goes in as typed, and reading it
      gives what the terminal sent, and an ioctl on pty0
      receives a byte with a line error. For the userspace
      tests until pseudo-terminals replace it
